===Etymology===
From the ''[[well]]'' near the [[bar]] (and thus handy to the bartender) holding bottles of liquor.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[mixed drink]] for which one does not specify the exact brand of [[liquor]] to be used.
#: {{ux|en|Don't order the '''well drinks''' there. They use the cheapest stuff they can find.}}

